<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Combined Motor interim shr, div slips.</title>
<headline>Combined Motor interim shr, div slips.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended August 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     18.5	  vs  22.7</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  5.0	  vs   6.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    3.64	 vs   4.39</p>
<p>    Tax			  2.23	 vs   2.80</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    4.19	 vs   5.38</p>
<p>    Turnover		 559.03	 vs 584.24</p>
<p>Div payable Dec 13</p>
<p>on register Nov 22</p>
<p>Full name: Combined Motor Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said it was actively pursuing all possible cost reduction measures and was continuously monitoring the level of its trading assets. But it said that it did not expect any improvement in trading conditions during the balance of the financial year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
